  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_01",
      "hash": "b42e6c6f487cb7ba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哦～[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的[VAR POKNAME(0003)]\\n眼神還真不錯……\\c\\n這孩子一定能學會我想出來的\\n非比尋常的招式！\\c\\n怎麼樣？要讓[VAR POKNAME(0003)]學學看\\n非比尋常的招式嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_02",
      "hash": "b42e6b6f487cb607",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗨！你們好啊！\\c\\n如何？要讓[VAR POKNAME(0003)]學學看\\n非比尋常的招式嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_03",
      "hash": "b42e6a6f487cb454",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哎呀呀，仔細一看……\\c\\n[VAR POKNAME(0003)]現在好像\\n沒這個需要呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_04",
      "hash": "b42e696f487cb2a1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR PKNICK(0000)]想要學習\\n[VAR MOVE(0001)]……\\c\\n為了學習[VAR MOVE(0001)]，\\n要忘記其他的招式嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_05",
      "hash": "b42e686f487cb0ee",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR PKNICK(0000)]\\n學會了[VAR MOVE(0001)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_06",
      "hash": "b42e676f487caf3b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "１[WAIT 20]、２[WAIT 20]…[WAIT 20]…[WAIT 20]空！[VAR SFX(0003)][VAR SFX(0000)]\\c\\n[VAR PKNICK(0000)]把[VAR MOVE(0002)]\\n的使用方法忘得一乾二淨了！\\c\\n於是……！\\c\\n[VAR PKNICK(0000)]學會了\\n[VAR MOVE(0001)]！[VAR SFX(0004)][VAR SFX(0001)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_07",
      "hash": "b42e666f487cad88",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR PKNICK(0000)]最終沒有學會\\n[VAR MOVE(0001)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_08",
      "hash": "b42e656f487cabd5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要和寶可夢一起……\\n建立非比尋常的關係喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_09",
      "hash": "b42e646f487caa22",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這樣啊……要是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳改變主意，\\n歡迎隨時再來喔。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_10",
      "hash": "b42ae76f48799fe4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要教牠哪個招式？"
    },
    {
